{"id":"H0687","lemma":"אֵ֫צֶר","transliteration":"etser","sayIt":"E-tser","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ezer","meaning":"A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.21;\nson of: Seir (H8165B);\nbrother of: Lotan (H3877), Shobal (H7732), Zibeon (H6649H), Anah (H6034H), Dishon (H1787), Dishan (H1789) and Timna (H8555H);\nfather of: Bilhan (H1092), Zaavan (H2190), Akan (H3292)\n§ Ezer = \"treasure\"\na chief of the Horites","glosses":["ezer"],"count":5,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ezer","kjv":"and Ezer"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ezer","kjv":"of Ezer"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ezer","kjv":"Ezer"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":38,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ezer","kjv":"and Ezer"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":42,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ezer","kjv":"of Ezer"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 36:21","note":"Dishon, Ezer, and Dishan. These are the chiefs who came of the Horites, the children of Seir in the land of Edom.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:38","note":"The sons of Seir: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, Dishon, Ezer, and Dishan.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1787","lemma":"דִּישֹׁן","transliteration":"dishon","gloss":"Dishon"},{"id":"H1789","lemma":"דִּישָׁן","transliteration":"dishan","gloss":"Dishan"},{"id":"H8165","lemma":"שֵׂעִיר","transliteration":"seir","gloss":"Seir"},{"id":"H3877","lemma":"לוֹטָן","transliteration":"lotan","gloss":"Lotan"},{"id":"H7732","lemma":"שׁוֹבָל","transliteration":"shoval","gloss":"Shobal"},{"id":"H6649","lemma":"צִבְעוֹן","transliteration":"tsivon","gloss":"Zibeon"},{"id":"H6034","lemma":"עֲנָה","transliteration":"anah","gloss":"Anah"},{"id":"H8555","lemma":"תִּמְנָע","transliteration":"timna","gloss":"Timna"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}